    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023460/extras/4b40983dc085a2e6099d2e9b2404af66.avif?t=1748327643\" width=616 height=357 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A horror mystery where the story unravels \u2014 and something else pushes through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're invited to Midnight Castle for what should be a simple mystery retreat. Solve puzzles, explore eerie environments, and piece together clues as you work your way deeper into the castle's strange and sinister story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023460/extras/fd1e51d67c42611cd0fdc9e92b70299e.avif?t=1748327643\" width=616 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023460/extras/5948ab88fb432bd4ea158cb8d9cc6096.avif?t=1748327643\" width=616 height=171 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a cast of flawed and unpredictable guests, each with their own reasons for attending \u2014 and their own secrets to keep. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023460/extras/d70c4483dc8a11798f2ec1a2ed5264ab.avif?t=1748327643\" width=616 height=70 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023460/extras/881de2f8e3a199c2d65e184ef51589fe.avif?t=1748327643\" width=616 height=555 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023460/extras/aa0550ccb0f74f567c2d86b9c7335820.webp?t=1748327643\" width=522 height=24 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Narrator guides your every move \u2014 sarcastic, defensive, and constantly scrambling to keep things running. Broken objects? Strange bugs? Missing UI? No problem (according to him). It\u2019s all part of the experience\u2026 probably.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something is... off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023460/extras/9db536e64f01402d7f0b73dd6a018cec.webp?t=1748327643\" width=186 height=24 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the night unfolds, however, things start to slip. Glitches grow worse. Puzzles twist and change. And something foreign \u2014 something malicious \u2014 begins rewriting the game according to rules beyond understanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A guided horror adventure with an unreliable narrator and fourth-wall breaking narration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a mystery that spirals into chaos as the narrator's grip weakens. Navigate shifting realities, face unexpected threats, and survive the story\u2019s collapse as Midnight Castle \u2014 and the game itself \u2014 fracture and distort.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023460/extras/4b40983dc085a2e6099d2e9b2404af66.avif?t=1748327643\" width=616 height=357 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A horror mystery where the story unravels \u2014 and something else pushes through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're invited to Midnight Castle for what should be a simple mystery retreat. Solve puzzles, explore eerie environments, and piece together clues as you work your way deeper into the castle's strange and sinister story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023460/extras/fd1e51d67c42611cd0fdc9e92b70299e.avif?t=1748327643\" width=616 height=87 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023460/extras/5948ab88fb432bd4ea158cb8d9cc6096.avif?t=1748327643\" width=616 height=171 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a cast of flawed and unpredictable guests, each with their own reasons for attending \u2014 and their own secrets to keep. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023460/extras/d70c4483dc8a11798f2ec1a2ed5264ab.avif?t=1748327643\" width=616 height=70 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023460/extras/881de2f8e3a199c2d65e184ef51589fe.avif?t=1748327643\" width=616 height=555 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023460/extras/aa0550ccb0f74f567c2d86b9c7335820.webp?t=1748327643\" width=522 height=24 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Narrator guides your every move \u2014 sarcastic, defensive, and constantly scrambling to keep things running. Broken objects? Strange bugs? Missing UI? No problem (according to him). It\u2019s all part of the experience\u2026 probably.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something is... off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3023460/extras/9db536e64f01402d7f0b73dd6a018cec.webp?t=1748327643\" width=186 height=24 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the night unfolds, however, things start to slip. Glitches grow worse. Puzzles twist and change. And something foreign \u2014 something malicious \u2014 begins rewriting the game according to rules beyond understanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A guided horror adventure with an unreliable narrator and fourth-wall breaking narration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a mystery that spirals into chaos as the narrator's grip weakens. Navigate shifting realities, face unexpected threats, and survive the story\u2019s collapse as Midnight Castle \u2014 and the game itself \u2014 fracture and distort.</p>",
